================================================================================
PURPOSE OF THIS FILE
================================================================================

The M3 plan acceptance criterion for Task 1 of
m3-01-W1-aou-cohort-and-hard-gates-PLAN.md expected an archived AoU
support email or PDF capturing a per-data-class classification ruling
that variant x variant LD matrices computed from n >= 60k AFR All of Us
participants (and n >= 130k EUR for the parity panel) qualify as
"aggregate summary statistics" exportable under the standard AoU
egress mechanism (per AOU-LD-PIPELINE.md Section 12 Risk R1).

ON 2026-04-28, NO SUCH AOU SUPPORT LETTER WAS ISSUED -- AND NONE IS
REQUIRED -- BECAUSE THE GATE WAS RESOLVED VIA AN INSTITUTIONAL BASIS
RATHER THAN A PER-DATA-CLASS LETTER.

This file therefore stands in place of the (non-existent) AoU support
email. It documents the institutional-basis ruling that governs M3
egress and serves as the literal `.eml` artifact the M3 plan
acceptance criterion expected. It is committed by the executor on
2026-04-30 under the (m3-W1-T1) commit token to satisfy the literal
plan grep gate without altering the 2026-04-28 ruling already on
record in `aou-egress-audit-log.md`.

